1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,181
Headphones look simple. The map behind them is not.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,365
Magnets like the ones in its drivers? More than 9 in 10 are made in China.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,007
Lithium for the battery is mostly refined in China too: about 7 in 10.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:21,077
And one Taiwan-based foundry takes about 7 in 10 of the world's contract chip sales.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,691
It all converges on electronics clusters in southern China.

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,123
Then it ships to everyone who presses play.
